  "bodyHash": "f3f96e273f42ff03",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V1HpUCC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1770\" height=\"870\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#f9c;font-size:24px\"><strong>由《Vic's Modern Warfare》原開發團隊打造的《Point Blank》是一款槍械模組，著重於社群貢獻，致力於打造與《Minecraft》美學風格高度契合的槍械內容。</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#9cf;font-size:24px\"><strong><em>現已支援《Minecraft》版本 1.20.1、1.21.1 與 1.21.11！</em></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;font-size:24px\"><strong>來看看這些內容包吧！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">《毀滅戰士》內容包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-doom-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XfaZVxe.png\" alt=\"Descriptive Text\" width=\"242\" height=\"242\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">《半衰期》內容包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-half-life-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_c9d74444-db0e-4ade-8d54-4da32a28f134.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"217\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">《GGO》內容包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-gun-gale-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_54242b54-6f70-4904-bfda-0ca4293dd260.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"215\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">《Point Blank》擴充版內容包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-point-blank-extended-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/961053/description_e637b9dd-e498-4151-a639-d2f2d08b73e4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"213\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">《命運》內容包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-destiny-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q3iL0A3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"213\" height=\"213\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">（官方）《碧藍檔案》內容包：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-blue-archive-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BHrUfDi.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"212\" height=\"212\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">《賽博朋克 2077》內容包（社群製作）：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/cyberpunk-2077-guns-for-vics-point-blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/996/840/64/64/638513964039333793.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">《最後一戰：冬季應變》內容包（社群製作）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/vpb-halo-winter-contingency\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1433/208/64/64/638928593681850821.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"138\" height=\"138\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在遊戲內管理這些內容包。或透過選單頂部的按鈕瀏覽器尋找更多內容包：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5yl3RSY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"536\" height=\"302\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>《Point Blank》以符合《Minecraft》美學風格的方式加入槍械，同時不犧牲高品質的模型與動畫。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>本模組的主要特色在於，即使完全沒有程式編寫知識或經驗，也能快速將您自製的高品質槍械加入遊戲中。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>這是一款極度便利的模組，若您已經準備好建模、貼圖與動畫完成的槍械，最快只需 10 分鐘即可將其加入遊戲。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>容易上手，輕鬆實作。</strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I5TEgBi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"622\" height=\"188\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1fjbZSU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"323\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cI6rcHk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"453\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K3wezC6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1184\" height=\"453\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>預設情況下，《Point Blank》已內建約 40 種武器（持續增加中）。其中多數槍械具備射擊模式，您可以按下「B」鍵進行切換。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>所有槍械均擁有高品質的換彈、檢視與拔槍動畫。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>槍械可能會有偏差。奔跑時武器的準確度會降低，瞄準時則會提升。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>生存模式：所有武器均可透過「武器列印機」在生存模式中製作！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m9udtQ7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J79QxYG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>客製化：武器支援安裝各式配件進行自訂！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UW3Tvel.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"752\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZSKeLsT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1167\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>製作《Point Blank》的內容需要兩項重要工具：Geckolib 與 Blockbench。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Blockbench 是一款第三方軟體，可讓您對物件進行建模、貼圖與動畫製作。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您還需在 Blockbench 中安裝 Geckolib 外掛。如需更多資訊，請參閱 Geckolib 說明文件中提供的 Geckolib 維基百科頁面。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>要開始使用，請先查看我們的<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/point-blank-official-extension-template-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方範本內容包</a></span>。您可利用它來製作屬於自己的內容。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong>教學影片：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ASlc1_bvItE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f9c\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lDwSw3pE_1k\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JEa0fKyU2QI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
